[{"title":"和王司徒元旦早朝之作","author":"杨巍","text":"身事清朝已历三，羡君华发尚宜簪。\n星回万里天将曙，燎映千门路更谙。\n虎拜转从新岁健，龙颜长并上公参。\n应陈国计匡明主，出入休言力不堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33527,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读骝山诸公所遗倡和诗有感次韵","author":"杨巍","text":"世间何物不成尘，惟有诗文重汉秦。\n偶诵赓吟如晤语，因思朋好欲沾巾。\n乾坤老去谁长在，江海人高半是贫。\n恨不当年同结社，莺花共醉百年春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33528,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诞日寓普明寺谒毗卢佛","author":"杨巍","text":"虚度八旬又一年，兹晨弧矢忆初悬。\n四方空抱风云志，千里仍多山水缘。\n数问蓬莱无道路，翻令老稚讶神仙。\n永怀慈母恩难报，白首焚香古佛前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33529,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"诞日寓回河寺兼赠慧上人","author":"杨巍","text":"回头身世叹尘埋，古寺暝投济水涯。\n乍入山门疑旧到，才逢老衲意相谐。\n惭予年过北溟望，羡汝法宗南岳怀。\n初度客中念慈母，佛前愿施八关斋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33530,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游灵岩寺","author":"杨巍","text":"八十二翁长闭关，为寻知己到名山。\n岩头云走如迎客，谷口花开似解颜。\n钟磬声来天地外，楼台色入有无间。\n老僧欲我留诗句，松月满空鹤未还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33531,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和吕山人夏日集岭园遇高生韵","author":"杨巍","text":"绿树阴浓覆短篱，相逢正是夏深时。\n种瓜不负青门约，对酒仍歌白苧词。\n燕掠纷纷来近渚，蝉鸣个个向高枝。\n天边忽报夕阳尽，为遇渔樵归去迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33532,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠董氏四兄弟","author":"杨巍","text":"商山洛社映千春，犹是东西南北人。\n那得同胞俱白首，况能高蹈远红尘。\n鸰声断续秋原静，棠树发生夜雨频。\n我亦龙钟两兄弟，可容作会海之滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33533,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题刘广文墨竹","author":"杨巍","text":"千载俄逢此墨君，茅斋顿觉起秋云。\n静怜疏影时相对，遥忆清风晚未闻。\n高节不随天地老，淡烟曾与蕙兰群。\n伊谁携向西窗坐，惟有能诗郑广文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33534,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郑于石于石讳国望越之高士也至日冒雪访予诗以赠之","author":"杨巍","text":"草屋雪天自拥衾，忽逢至日动孤吟。\n即今门径人踪绝，何处梅花月影深。\n剡水尚思回夜棹，燕山犹记满朝簪。\n君来正是闭关夕，共我围炉坐竹林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33535,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"走笔和王同野韵","author":"杨巍","text":"明时谁复问渔矶，赢得经春昼掩扉。\n祗为小山丛桂在，况逢浮世与心违。\n天边梦断云霄侣，阶下恩深鸟雀饥。\n闻说年来能悟道，餐霞不采首阳薇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33536,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王少尹祈雨有应","author":"杨巍","text":"四月荒田苦未耕，谁从穷海问苍生。\n祗因少尹心如水，遂有甘霖夜满城。\n堪笑阴阳虚纵闭，岂知天地自和平。\n请君明日南郊望，遍野农歌杂颂声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33537,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孟仲传","author":"杨巍","text":"声名早已动三台，河朔风流自异才。\n讲道忽惊兼孔墨，论交不说似陈雷。\n百年湖海占星聚，五月葵榴对酒开。\n别后思君何处切，暮云春树隔蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33538,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲性聪和尚","author":"杨巍","text":"每坐更深香自焚，行年八十断声闻。\n已知阴魄随风尽，何处法身逐化分。\n滤水有罗仍挂壁，乡人结社竞参坟。\n禅家寂灭休垂泪，为买碑刊大鉴文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33539,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁字沽","author":"杨巍","text":"可怪直沽水，翻为丁字流。\n扁舟何处去，风起浪悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33540,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃花口","author":"杨巍","text":"泊舟桃花口，不见桃花树。\n惟有捕鱼人，日暮放歌去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33541,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"载酒亭四绝为纪山赋 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"山云浮雪舫，溪月上花台。\n奇字主人识，谁能载酒来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33542,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"载酒亭四绝为纪山赋 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"袅袅孤云入，嘤嘤双鸟鸣。\n诗成留客醉，棋罢绕花行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33543,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"载酒亭四绝为纪山赋 其三","author":"杨巍","text":"琴尊虚槛里，独坐有高人。\n月映桐花夕，风归柳叶春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"载酒亭四绝为纪山赋 其四","author":"杨巍","text":"每到花开日，携觞坐此亭。\n醉来拚一笑，不为访玄经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤山独秀","author":"杨巍","text":"谁将一片石，高插向晴昊。\n留与路人看，天风吹不倒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上谣","author":"杨巍","text":"年年筑边城，敌骑犹出没。\n夜深沙月寒，空照杞梁骨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古思边二首 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"久戍在边头，春来忽已秋。\n雁传天外信，人倚梦中楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拟古思边二首 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"自是良家子，十年九在边。\n鬓毛白已尽，何日勒燕然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"杨巍","text":"夙心厌烦扰，无事即羲皇。\n山入晓窗碧，风吹午院凉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生老病死佛家以为四苦宋人又借此以诮权贵今反之为四绝句焉 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"无虑复何私，人皆孩视之。\n一啼并一笑，犹似未生时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生老病死佛家以为四苦宋人又借此以诮权贵今反之为四绝句焉 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"甫看血气衰，百事一无为。\n白发茅檐下，从教日晷移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生老病死佛家以为四苦宋人又借此以诮权贵今反之为四绝句焉 其三","author":"杨巍","text":"南北罢驱驰，闭门高卧时。\n不生又不灭，惟有达摩知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生老病死佛家以为四苦宋人又借此以诮权贵今反之为四绝句焉 其四","author":"杨巍","text":"归去是便宜，蒙庄愤世词。\n人生如昼夜，此理不须推。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"晚岁习禅寂，已无世上情。\n如何深夜里，犹自感秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"天心元不动，寒暑自推移。\n独爱陶家酒，绝无宋玉悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其三","author":"杨巍","text":"高林叶亦落，何况于蒿莱。\n怪尔岭头菊，迎霜尚未开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其四","author":"杨巍","text":"今年大雨水，家住九河边。\n不虑贫无食，翻思买钓船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其五","author":"杨巍","text":"荣枯观物理，万事总如斯。\n无虑复何遣，惟吟靖节诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其六","author":"杨巍","text":"为问南归雁，徘徊恋稻梁。\n寒云几千里，何日到江乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其七","author":"杨巍","text":"种麦此时节，阅耕原上田。\n衰年筋力少，惟执打牛鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其八","author":"杨巍","text":"结草为庐舍，人称安乐窝。\n秋风满天地，将柰此中何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其九","author":"杨巍","text":"向晚蛩声杂，凄凄篱落边。\n老夫方醉卧，魂梦绕钧天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其十","author":"杨巍","text":"一年惟此月，清比高人心。\n独坐小楼望，不知兴浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其十一","author":"杨巍","text":"不见安期枣，已无邵氏瓜。\n岭桃才半熟，气味逼仙家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋园杂兴 其十二","author":"杨巍","text":"犹是仲秋月，菊花尚未然。\n故人念狂客，先送酒家钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题渔樵图各一首示知己者 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"终日江头坐，临流非羡鱼。\n狂澜嗟未倒，愁思竟何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题渔樵图各一首示知己者 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"不断终南路，难辞金马门。\n去留两未得，俯仰愧乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿凌云寺二绝句 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"系马夕阳边，山僧讶客至。\n门开古殿秋，云是凌云寺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿凌云寺二绝句 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"野寺一僧住，朔风万里来。\n敌营犹未徙，猎火照边台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊居","author":"杨巍","text":"秋苔青遍野，寂寞惬郊居。\n何处山僧至，门前响木鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日南墅宴集","author":"杨巍","text":"南郭春偏好，留人到夕阳。\n风吹山鸟语，花落酒杯香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客中","author":"杨巍","text":"到处悲新事，连宵梦故林。\n鬓毛谁愿白，无柰客中心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游善卷洞","author":"杨巍","text":"五月吾来此，洞中凉似秋。\n问僧拓石刻，携去记曾游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻王柳滨谪楚中二首 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"闻近长沙地，应悲屈贾魂。\n莫言谪戍苦，不死是君恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻王柳滨谪楚中二首 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"一自潞河别，几看秋草生。\n哭君无限泪，不是世人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读庄子","author":"杨巍","text":"富贵浮云尔，死生一梦焉。\n此中谁解得，空诵远游篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"杨巍","text":"正是小春天，欲眠不得眠。\n方为诗思苦，又办酒家钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯桥","author":"杨巍","text":"愧我尘埃客，两过丁卯桥。\n徘徊醉吟处，碧树自萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿穆陵关次壁间韵","author":"杨巍","text":"一路入千山，行人日不閒。\n那堪霜月白，独宿穆陵关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独坐","author":"杨巍","text":"亭空寒落叶，野近暮多云。\n何处鸣孤鹤，坐中怅独闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过存上人墓","author":"杨巍","text":"路左孤坟在，何方示化身。\n惟留桥上月，长渡往来人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题空尘画","author":"杨巍","text":"不听松风起，山窗生暮寒。\n惟愁天地老，留此画图看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"认和尚号一庵诗以代偈","author":"杨巍","text":"未认犹为二，既认一亦无。\n一无两不得，何处著工夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偏关北望","author":"杨巍","text":"耕牧春仍废，台隍敌作邻。\n受降城不远，恢复是何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"京衢谣","author":"杨巍","text":"风寒僵马足，雪厚没车轮。\n可怪九衢内，犹多来往人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闵旱二首万历庚子作 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"一旱忽四年，天心忍若此。\n居乡无片长，自愧何穷已。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闵旱二首万历庚子作 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"沟壑不忍视，一视泪如雨。\n凭谁请发棠，空饱仓中鼠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"敏上人坐禅诗以嘲之 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"真僧亦在市，大道不归山。\n为问敏和尚，如何学闭关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"敏上人坐禅诗以嘲之 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"寂照原无二，休从寂一边。\n宗门曾有语，作镜不磨砖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘲儒","author":"杨巍","text":"尼父不言静，后儒何怪哉。\n纷纷诸语录，皆自五灯来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"病卧独亲药裹，诗成不负年华。\n汩汩门前流水，青青山上人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"梦绕床头诗卷，榻依洞口烟萝。\n谁遣村童送酒，忽听野鸟如歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿董宪长七十","author":"杨巍","text":"去国竟难明薏苡，一官元是为丹砂。\n要知天地酬君意，七十谁能鬓未华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题舍弟二川卷","author":"杨巍","text":"惠连此地掩郊扉，为爱邻家尽钓矶。\n况是沧江秋色好，隔原频见鹡鸰飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日送华空尘还章丘","author":"杨巍","text":"高秋红叶映柴关，几夜论诗杯酒间。\n别去故园明日是，寒花开遍女郎山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王兵宪寄秋日诗韵 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"白日无多其柰秋，每逢清夜共谁游。\n吟成张翰黄花句，醉上庾家明月楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王兵宪寄秋日诗韵 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"世事犹能入梦魂，却因多病乞文园。\n向来三辅论兵地，短剑长缨动塞门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和王兵宪寄秋日诗韵 其三","author":"杨巍","text":"关山北望漫踌蹰，闻道单于款塞初。\n此日江湖堪自慰，知君不向酒杯疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘广文父九十 其一","author":"杨巍","text":"只今客傍秦王岛，何似家连碣石宫。\n自是刘晨仙骨在，百年无地不春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿刘广文父九十 其二","author":"杨巍","text":"才名早动九陵边，迎养仍开苜蓿筵。\n谁遣黄金收骏马，空教豪士得长年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东关寺杏花","author":"杨巍","text":"野寺寻芳日已斜，春风无力挽飞花。\n不知开落谁为主，欲向山僧问法华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日柬门人李生卧病","author":"杨巍","text":"柳色青黄二月初，吾徒犹自检方书。\n纵然出郭兼携酒，眼底何人最起予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过鸡鸣山忆王少参","author":"杨巍","text":"下临诸塞上摩空，百丈天桥一径通。\n可怪两人俱好事，夜深曾到白云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]